Organizer -- UC05
Organizer -- UC07
Judge -- UC05
Judge -- UC06
Judge -- UC07
Judge -- UC08
Judge -- UC09
UC05 ..> UC14 : <<include>>
UC06 ..> UC14 : <<include>>
UC07 ..> UC14 : <<include>>
UC08 ..> UC15 : <<include>>
UC09 ..> UC15 : <<include>>
@enduml

